<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Survival</Major>
    <Description>Trains the survival skill, use in 1920 x 1080  full screen,  place 2 rag stips on the ground infront of you with nothing else around to interfere with the craft make sure they arent highlighted (red box around them) and start the macro, it will craft and uncraft bundles of ragstips for you works as of 0.8 and the new drop down options! have fun :) </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
